# Zoom room for The Top 1% community calls. The function forwards to Zoom and
# records who joined. To change the room, edit ZOOM_URL in netlify/functions/zoom.ts.
# The member id rides in the path, not a query string: Netlify copies an
# incoming query string onto the Zoom URL it redirects to.
/zoom/*    /.netlify/functions/zoom   200!
/zoom      /.netlify/functions/zoom   200!

# Top 1% answer pages: one static page serves every /answer/<request id>.
/answer/*  /answer/index.html   200!

# The install slot picker and the capacity readout are functions, not pages.
# These must sit ABOVE the SPA catch-all: Netlify takes the first rule that
# matches, so /* was swallowing them and serving the marketing homepage instead.
# A 200 came back either way, which is how it went unnoticed.
/slot      /.netlify/functions/install-slot   200!
/capacity  /.netlify/functions/capacity       200!

